      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"getting things back on track\" ... how? there is no track. i'm talking about the house, the savings, my entire life just evaporating in a few weeks. there is no \"step\" to take when you're already underwater. it's just math. the math says i owe way more than i could ever make in ten lifetimes. i'm just a burden to everyone. i can see the look in my family's eyes, they're just waiting for the inevitable. there's no way to fix this. it's just a dead end.",
